@startuml
title Alert Lifecycle State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "OPEN" as Open
state "RESOLVED" as Resolved

[*] --> Open : alert condition detected
Open --> Resolved : condition cleared or resolved
Resolved --> [*]

note bottom of Open
Examples: unknown tag, offline node,
and unauthorized movement.
end note

note bottom of Resolved
ACKNOWLEDGED is omitted unless the
backend implements that status.
end note
@enduml
